RuoYi upstream (thin shell)
---------------------------
Parts of this repository provide a thin runtime / auth / configuration /
admin-demo shell, including modules under ruoyi-*. Those parts originate
from or follow RuoYi-Vue patterns.

RuoYi-Vue is licensed under the MIT License.
Upstream: https://gitee.com/y_project/RuoYi-Vue

See also RUOYI_UPSTREAM.txt for the imported upstream version record.

Boundary
--------
The openbiz-* business capability modules are the focus of this project
and are intended for independent Maven consumption.

RuoYi-related modules are retained mainly as the current runtime /
auth / configuration shell for demos and hosting - not as the product
identity of OpenBiz. OpenBiz is not positioned as a RuoYi replacement.

